[statement]
A name a package installed for a carried name answers reserves nothing by
its preliminary choice. `r`, whose condition never holds, needs `F`, and
`f1`, its best candidate, would hold `K` against `s1`; but `z`, a carried
name decided before `S`, provides `F` itself, so `S` takes `s1`. Contrast
`install-if/a-condition-that-never-holds-reserves-a-provider`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:n z

P:n
V:1

P:z
V:1
p:F
D:S F

P:r
V:1
i:n zz
D:F

P:f1
V:1
k:100
p:F K=1

P:f2
V:1
k:10
p:F

P:s1
V:1
k:100
p:S K=1

P:s2
V:1
k:10
p:S

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install n 1
install s1 1
install z 1
install top 1
